{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"本接口用于线索通表单的更新修改，可更新基础信息模块、分层表单、高级设置等内容，支持增量更新，目前不支持elements模块的修改。\",\"id\":\"clue.form.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/clue/form/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710635816975\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access-token.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要授权access-token，需通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710635816975\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"更新表单\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vuJ9blOd\">本接口用于表单的更新修改，主要可更新如下：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MmsQJWcV\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kHKEMPHA\">基础信息模块</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-UxgB5Iri\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hFuGnfYE\">包含表单名称，不会在C端体现出来</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-U0LBO6sp\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0CoxIQBM\">分层表单</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-J25GYKiU\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FjCN4DDr\">分层内部的元素同样对应elements</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LtZybxn8\">结合字段：enable_layer + layer_submit_text</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-m7mWk21s\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4hcVFvsD\">高级设置</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-RFyfMKdC\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WntUV7Im\">高级设置属于扩展功能，目前主要包含三项内容：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"ucdeb4d9-CXRXkWsi\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YzFVA6e5\">计数设置</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u83fe6cd-Ls2nSEZB\" data-indent=\"3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tJ2KFQ7z\">包含递增和递减两种类型</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BHSYP5e2\">基于计数前文案+计数值+计数后文案拼接完整方案</li></ul><ul data-id=\"ucdeb4d9-WZ8FIM0q\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KxENQRpC\">展示报名用户：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u83fe6cd-FUbMorD2\" data-indent=\"3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JMG4Uqeh\">包含滚动墙和滚动条两种类型</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CjSdmP8x\">基于已提交用户信息展示数据</li></ul><ul data-id=\"ucdeb4d9-79ie5XOG\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MzdWn1bf\">提交成功提示语：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u83fe6cd-B0irhV0T\" data-indent=\"3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9DLkhONC\">商家端额外通知用户的信息，如“24h内联系您“ 支持增量更新，目前不支持elements模块的修改。</li></ul>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772942110506055%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-XMPTNaKH\" id=\"h6f20189-XMPTNaKH\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-K0QPpa9B\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/form/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/form/update/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710635816975\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-d076lo8I\" id=\"h6f20189-d076lo8I\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZNGrs7RQ\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-MBpmZ0XQ\" id=\"h6f20189-MBpmZ0XQ\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-gGTUDlmX\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-XRJff7CO\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-g5hfFwHF\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-v9uUWZQp\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-bM2lPcY8\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-P3dEUZm4\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-72Ef6ZhQ\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-cAEYYcEU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margi