=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-VpsqKFuj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tBAuKFsb\">layer_submit_text</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-sqafCI5O\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0pkH5pvJ\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-MoXCV3Z1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jcJa7jbR\">分层提交文案说明，分层信息在Elements中，当不开启分层时，所有分层信息无效。文案长度不超过8个字符</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-ZshRWlGI\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-5Mc9RF9x\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-L1UD0Dmr\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"></span>extend_info</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-uM6jQp7q\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Cf4WtXbM\">json</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-mBhJ5GP6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-se